# 36. Dataset Format

Use two datasets.

## Command Dataset

```text
commands.yaml
```

Contains verified commands.

## Training Dataset

```text
training.jsonl
```

Contains natural-language queries.

Example:

```json
{
  "query": "how do I restart a kubernetes deployment",
  "command_id": "kubernetes-rollout-restart",
  "technology": "kubernetes",
  "intent": "restart_deployment"
}
```

