# 37. Training Dataset Requirements

Each command should have multiple query variations.

Minimum:

```text
5-15 queries per command
```

Include:

### Beginner

```text
how do I restart a deployment
```

### Experienced

```text
kubectl rollout restart deployment
```

### Informal

```text
restart my k8s deployment
```

### Abbreviation

```text
restart k8s deploy
```

### Typo

```text
restart kubernets deployment
```

### Conceptual

```text
how can I recreate the pods for a deployment
```

The training pipeline should normalize these.

