# 46. Safety Classifier

Implement a safety layer independent of the ML retrieval model.

Classify commands as:

```text
safe
warning
dangerous
```

Examples:

Safe:

```bash
kubectl get pods
docker ps
git status
cargo check
go test
```

Warning:

```bash
kubectl rollout restart deployment/<deployment>
docker system prune
git reset --hard HEAD~1
terraform apply
```

Dangerous:

```bash
kubectl delete namespace <namespace>
docker system prune -a
git push --force
terraform destroy
rm -rf <path>
```

