# 47. Never Execute Commands

This is mandatory.

AlchemyCLI AI must NEVER:

```text
execute shell commands
execute subprocesses from retrieved commands
execute generated commands
modify the user's system
```

The application only displays and copies commands.

---

# 48. Dangerous Command UX

For dangerous commands:

```text
⚠ DANGEROUS

terraform destroy

This command can permanently destroy infrastructure.

[Copy Anyway]
```

Copying is allowed after explicit confirmation.

Execution is NEVER supported.

