# 139. Final Safety Principle

When multiple commands have materially different consequences:

```text
DO NOT GUESS.
ASK.
```

Example:

```text
"delete my docker images"
```

could mean:

```text
remove one image
remove dangling images
remove unused images
remove all unused images
```

The system should clarify.

